addiction-craving-nicotine = You crave a smoke. It is hard to relax without nicotine.
addiction-craving-alcohol = You feel chills and keep thinking about having a drink.
addiction-craving-stimulants = You feel exhausted and crave another stimulant.
addiction-craving-narcotics = You feel weak and restless. Your thoughts return to the substance.
addiction-craving-aphrodisiac = You feel restless and miss the familiar effect of the aphrodisiac.
addiction-craving-excitement = It is hard to stop thinking about taking the substance again.
addiction-stage-1 = For now, it is only a persistent craving.
addiction-stage-2 = Withdrawal is beginning to affect how you feel.
addiction-stage-3 = The withdrawal symptoms are becoming pronounced.
addiction-stage-4 = Withdrawal has reached its peak. You need help.
addiction-intoxication = You feel sick and unsteady. You may have taken too much.
trait-category-addiction-history = Habits and recovery
trait-smoker-name = Smoker
trait-smoker-desc = You occasionally crave a cigarette. This permanent habit cannot be cured, but does not itself cause severe withdrawal.
trait-recovering-addict-name = Quitting smoking
trait-recovering-alcohol-name = Quitting drinking
trait-recovering-alcohol-desc = You stopped drinking, but dependence remains. Abstinence and treatment help you recover.
trait-recovering-addict-desc = You stopped smoking, but cravings remain. Abstinence and treatment help you recover.
trait-habitual-drinker-name = Habitual drinker
trait-habitual-drinker-desc = You occasionally want a drink. A permanent habit without severe withdrawal; excessive use is still dangerous.
trait-habitual-drug-user-name = Habitual drug user
trait-habitual-drug-user-desc = You occasionally crave familiar substances. A permanent habit without severe withdrawal; excessive use is still dangerous.
addiction-habit-nicotine = You feel like taking your usual cigarette break.
addiction-habit-alcohol = You recall the familiar taste of a drink.
addiction-habit-narcotics = Your thoughts briefly return to familiar substances.
